text Nagisa stands up to trade places with me and ducks under the curtain.
text I should use the hairdryer first.
text I plug it in, and right as I go to switch it on...
text *Shht*
text The sound of rustling cloth.
text I look back at the curtain.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Now that I think about it... I've never been in a situation like this before...)
text I see Nagisa's bare feet from under the curtain.
text And now, her skirt is on the floor next to them.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Well... If I get excited over something as small as this, then we must be far from doing anything serious...)
text But then again, we're living as a couple.
text Even Nagisa must be prepared to face that kind of thing.
text No matter how far it may be...
text @[Tomoya]
text (Oh, what am I thinking?)
text I avert my eyes from the curtain.
text The two of us decided to start doing our best so that we can live on our own. What does it say about me if I'm not able to control my desires on the very first day?
text ......
text I hear the door close.
text @[Tomoya]
text (But...)
text @[Tomoya]
text (This kind of stress only builds up when you're a guy... I can only control myself for so long...)
text I look at the curtain once more.
choice Calm down|Decide that it's fine as long as you're not caught
