text (...)
music BGM01.mp3
text I suddenly think that we must look ridiculous.
text Our new life as of today seems like nothing more than us playing house.
text I was able to make it this far entirely because of my determination to make Nagisa happy on my own...
text But I'm sure that the two of us are going to face many more hurdles.
text I know things don't go that well in reality.
text Yet it feels that the two of us are so immature that we might easily fold to that reality.
text Unless we can overcome it, we'll never know what true strength is.
text We just think that we're working hard right now.
text And maybe the old man and Sanae-san are thinking the same thing.
text That this is nothing more than a youthful indiscretion.
text If we want to try, then fine, we can try.
text Just as long as we're still within reach.
