text @[Tomoya]
text Starting tomorrow, I'm going to be working in a new place. The old man and Sanae-san won't be there, and I won't be able to fall back on the kindness of others.
text @[Tomoya]
text It'll probably be even tougher than I'm thinking it will be.
sound M8Z.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Yeah.
text @[Tomoya]
text And you're working really hard right now too.
sound M90.aac
