text @[Yoshino]
text It's a big change.
text Yoshino-san looks straight forward while talking to me as we drive to our work site.
text @[Tomoya]
text Eh? What do you mean?
text I reply with a question of my own from the passenger's seat.
sound M9O.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text You're like a different person from the day I first met you.
text @[Tomoya]
text Is that so...
sound M9P.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Yeah. You were a total child back then.
text @[Tomoya]
text So do I look more like an adult to you now?
sound M9Q.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text No...
sound M9R.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text You look like a kid who's fighting with everything he's got to become an adult.
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh... So I still seem like a child to you.
sound M9S.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text But you're totally different.
text @[Tomoya]
text How's that?
sound M9T.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Well, you're serious now, for one.
text That's true... That does seem like a big difference.
text Right, because without a drive to move forward, a child will never stop being a child.
sound M9U.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text I'm expecting great things from you.
text @[Tomoya]
text Okay!
sound M9V.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Also... please don't quit after one day. You're going to depress me if you do.
text @[Tomoya]
text Don't worry. I'm serious about this.
sound ~
sound M9W.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Okay, then let's go.
text The car stops.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah.
text We open our doors simultaneously.
