text I'm unable to reply. He explains to me how to pass a lifeline through the street lamp's brace and put my weight behind me in order to support it.
text I'm not able to, though. The explanation is simple, sure, but doing what he's told me to isn't exactly easy when I'm not standing on the actual ground.
text Not to mention, I don't think I'd be able to readjust my weight anyway while atop a ladder. Even if I'm just a few meters up, it's still scary.
sound MAI.aac
