text You learn how to do this job by watching others and imitating them. That's where you start.
sound MAU.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Listen. If you mess up in this line of work, it's over for you.
sound MAV.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text What would you do if a street lamp you installed fell to the ground?
text I'd probably─ no, I'd definitely feel horrible.
sound MAW.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text And what if someone important to you was under that lamp?
text What if someone important was under a falling lamp...? I think of Nagisa.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'd never want that to happen.
